# ── Model artifacts ──
# backend/crop_recommendation_model.joblib, backend/yield_model/ and
# backend/disease_model/ (model.onnx + preprocess.json) are COMMITTED on purpose
# — Render's build needs them and prefetch_models.py fails the build if they are
# absent. Do not add them here.
#
# backend/RandomForest.pkl, backend/crop_yield_model.pkl (85 MB) and
# backend/model_info.json are ALREADY TRACKED and describe the superseded
# 10-feature yield pipeline that main.py no longer loads. .gitignore cannot
# untrack them; that needs `git rm --cached <file>` (history keeps the blobs
# either way).

# ── ML training scratch ──
# Vendored interpreters and duplicated model copies. The training sources
# themselves (notebooks, CSVs, crop_rec/src) are left trackable on purpose —
# the paper cites them.
.pydeps/
crop prediction/.pydeps/
crop prediction/saved_model/
crop prediction/notebook_execution.log
crop prediction/notebook_execution.err.log
crop_rec/models/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── LaTeX build artifacts ──
# figures/ is NOT ignored — research_paper.tex \includegraphics from it, so the
# paper cannot be rebuilt from a fresh clone without those files.
build_report/
tectonic.zip
tectonic_bin/
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.synctex.gz
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.bbl
*.blg

# ── Local machine leftovers ──
ipconfig_output.txt
dummy.txt

# ── HuggingFace cache ──
# Only populated on a dev machine now, by export_disease_onnx.py. The deployed
# backend never touches the Hub.
backend/.hf_cache/
.hf_cache/
